@startuml

title Saga: completed steps are compensated in reverse when a later step fails

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber

participant "process manager" as pm
participant "service A" as a
participant "service B" as b
participant "service C" as c

pm -> a : step 1
a --> pm : completed
pm -> b : step 2
b --> pm : completed
pm -> c : step 3
c --> pm : failed (error)
pm -> b : compensate step 2
b --> pm : compensated
pm -> a : compensate step 1
a --> pm : compensated
note over pm : the run ends compensated;\nno step held a lock across services
@enduml
